  "implementationNotes": [
    "Use semantic roles at every call site; never reference raw palette names (Oat, Evergreen, Soft red, Muted red, Blue/Lavender/Green) or hex values in feature code.",
    "Assign product-specific meanings to categoryBlue/categoryLavender/categoryGreen only once inside the consumer adapter or token generator.",
    "Filled custom actions omit decorative borders by default (policy.actionBorder='borderless-filled'); essential editable-field boundaries and full 2px/3px focus rings remain mandatory.",
    "Evergreen (#3f7057) and Muted red (#ad4648) have 1.02:1 luminance separation; action names and distinct symbols carry primary decision meaning.",
    "Arithmetic luminance checks verify solid color pairs only; they do not certify rendered compositing, typography legibility, keyboard flow or assistive technology acceptance."
  ],
